.SH NAME
inspekt\-restart \- Restart bridge and API servers.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]restart\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Restart bridge and API servers.
.PP
Stops any running servers, checks for accessibility engine updates, then
starts servers fresh in daemon mode.
.PP
\f[B]Options:\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-docs\f[R]: Also start local MkDocs documentation server
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-api\-port\f[R]: Custom API port (default: 8000)
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-bridge\-port\f[R]: Custom bridge port (default: 8765)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\(enforeground\f[R]
Run in foreground with unified output
.TP
